  "condiciones": "modelo estático calibrado sobre datos EBA reales pero con parámetros de haircut/densidad de libro elegidos heurísticamente (α=1/(300M), g(s)=7/10−αs); sin shock externo aplicado, solo para fines demostrativos",
  "robustez": "baja",
  "cita_textual": "total liquidations (Figure 1a) increase as the interest rate increases, whereas the total borrowing (Figure 1b) is exactly the reverse of the total liquidations and, as such, is decreasing as the interest rate increases",
  "doc_id": 23,
  "doc_titulo": "A Repo Model of Fire Sales with VWAP and LOB Pricing Mechanisms"
