  "magnitud": "Ratio de Sharpe de 2.25 y drawdown máximo mantenido por debajo del 18%.",
  "condiciones": "Rolling-window backtesting framework con verificación out-of-sample estricta.",
  "robustez": "media",
  "cita_textual": "the strategy achieves a Sharpe ratio of 2.25, keeping the maximum draw under 18 per cent, which suggests a favourable balance between yield and risk exposure.",
  "doc_id": 87,
  "doc_titulo": "Design of a Quantitative Futures Trading Model Incorporating Multimodal Feature Fusion and Tail Risk Control"
 },
 {
  "afirmacion": "La integración del mecanismo de control de riesgo de cola reduce sustancialmente la probabilidad de pérdidas severas y mejora la estabilidad de los precios durante escenarios de mercado volátiles.",
  "mercado": "Stock index and commodity futures",
  "periodo": "Continuous historical period",
  "magnitud": "El VaR al 95% mejora de -6.84% a -4.12%, la pérdida diaria máxima cae de -4.96% a -2.71%, y la frecuencia de eventos de pérdida extrema desciende de 7.3 a 3.1.",
  "condiciones": "Pruebas durante condiciones de mercado altamente volátiles (highly volatile market conditions).",
  "robustez": "media",
  "cita_textual": "the risk-aware model demonstrates a substantial reduction in extreme loss exposure compared with the baseline framework... the 95% Value-at-Risk (VaR) improves from −6.84% to −4.12%",
  "doc_id": 87,
  "doc_titulo": "Design of a Quantitative Futures Trading Model Incorporating Multimodal Feature Fusion and Tail Risk Control"
 },
 {
  "afirmacion": "Excluir características multimodales (texto o microestructura) degrada de forma considerable el desempeño predictivo y la capacidad para capturar oportunidades de trading a corto plazo.",
  "mercado": "Stock index and commodity futures",
  "periodo": "Continuous historical period",
  "magnitud": "Sin texto, el retorno anualizado cae del 21.6% al 16.3% (Information Ratio de 1.84 a 1.29). Sin microestructura, el win rate cae al 55.2%.",
  "condiciones": "Estudio de ablación (ablation studies) eliminando componentes individuales.",
  "robustez": "media",
  "cita_textual": "When the text mode is excluded, the average return of the model is reduced from 21.6% to 16.3%, and the information ratio is reduced from 1.84 to 1.29. The win ratio drops to 55.2 per cent when the microstructural mode is eliminated",
  "doc_id": 87,
  "doc_titulo": "Design of a Quantitative Futures Trading Model Incorporating Multimodal Feature Fusion and Tail Risk Control"
 },
 {
  "afirmacion": "La eliminación del mecanismo de atención orientado al riesgo de cola incrementa la severidad de los drawdowns y la duración de las rachas de pérdidas, demostrando su necesidad para estabilizar el portafolio.",
  "mercado": "Stock index and commodity futures",
  "periodo": "Continuous historical period",
  "magnitud": "El drawdown máximo promedio aumenta de -2.71% a -3.98%, la desviación estándar de retornos sube de 1.42% a 2.06%, y los días de pérdida consecutiva máxima crecen de 3.2 a 5.7.",
  "condiciones": "Estudio de ablación.",
  "robustez": "media",
  "cita_textual": "the removal of the tail risk attention mechanism results in a worsening of risk metrics. The average maximum drawdown is increased from -2.71% to -3.98%",
  "doc_id": 87,
  "doc_titulo": "Design of a Quantitative Futures Trading Model Incorporating Multimodal Feature Fusion and Tail Risk Control"
 },
 {
