  "robustez": "alta",
  "cita_textual": "If 0 < γ < γ0, then, the Merton problem is ill-posed. In particular, the agent’s maximal expected utility of wealth increases rapidly with the investment horizon T and approaches infinity at a finite critical horizon T_N(γ) > 0",
