  "robustez": "alta",
  "cita_textual": "Friedman repeated-measures tests indicate significant frequency effects for total return, χ² (4) = 99.43, p < .001, and Sharpe ratio, χ² (4) = 77.07, p < .001. The strongest effect appears in turnover, χ² (4) = 270.88, p < .001",
